3. Trailing zero: misc TO_CHAR behavior     

===================================================
    
3-1. TO_CHAR(number) with no format removes trailing zeros, so 1.0 and 1.00 both print 1 and compare equal     

===================================================
a    b    c    
1     1     1     

===================================================
    
3-2. TO_CHAR with no format removes trailing zeros, so the two text concatenations are identical     

